    "detailed_description": "<strong>&quot;Dami and Secret Library!&quot;</strong><br>In this game, you become Dami, a young girl on a journey to meet her late mother in a mysterious secret library. <br>This is a third-person 3D healing adventure set in a fairytale-like world, where players can experience Dami\u2019s warm and emotional journey. <br>The game also incorporates light platformer elements, adding an extra layer of exploration and adventure.<br><br>The first episode consists of 8 levels and offers a playtime of around 15 minutes with an easy difficulty level. <br>Due to its short playtime, the game does not include a save or load system. <br>Immerse yourself in the magical library and join Dami on her heartfelt journey to recover precious memories of her mother.<br>Have Fun!<br><br>View more detail about the game in Store Page Trailer!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>&quot;Dami and Secret Library!&quot;</strong><br>In this game, you become Dami, a young girl on a journey to meet her late mother in a mysterious secret library. <br>This is a third-person 3D healing adventure set in a fairytale-like world, where players can experience Dami\u2019s warm and emotional journey. <br>The game also incorporates light platformer elements, adding an extra layer of exploration and adventure.<br><br>The first episode consists of 8 levels and offers a playtime of around 15 minutes with an easy difficulty level. <br>Due to its short playtime, the game does not include a save or load system. <br>Immerse yourself in the magical library and join Dami on her heartfelt journey to recover precious memories of her mother.<br>Have Fun!<br><br>View more detail about the game in Store Page Trailer!",
